<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/business> linkml:description "How the business or its application works, or a code of practice it chose to follow." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/collect> linkml:description "Get PII from the person it is about, or from another source." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/consult> linkml:description "Look at PII without taking a copy away." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/contract> linkml:description "An agreement between parties, such as one with a processor, or rules that bind a group of companies." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/contractual> linkml:description "A binding agreement, such as one with a processor or across a group of companies." .
