	linkml:slot_uri "http://schema.org/description"^^xsd:anyURI .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/destroy> linkml:description "Remove PII and whatever carried it, beyond recovery." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/direct_identifier> linkml:description "It singles out one person by itself, such as a passport number." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/disclose> linkml:description "Make PII available to another party." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/disseminate> linkml:description "Spread PII widely, such as by publishing it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso29100/distinguishing_trait> linkml:description "It sets one person apart, alone or with other details, such as a rare job title in a small town." .
